      "Description": {
        "Namespace": "",
        "Key": "5767D4BC4557A3E2FC6E0A8CBEB70512",
        "SourceString": "Ydrassa, goddess of water, personifies the power and mystery of water in all its forms. As a primordial sea deity, Ydrassa governs not only the oceans but also rivers, lakes, and the life-giving properties of water. This goddess is both nurturing and potentially destructive, capable of providing abundant harvests from the sea or unleashing devastating floods. Ydrassa is often associated with the cycles of tides, the depths of the oceans, and the creatures that dwell within. Legends speak of her ability to calm storms or create new landforms with the power of water.",
